sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Agent as Agent Planner
  participant Engine as Farabi Engine
  participant Policy as Governance
  participant Viz as Chart / A2UI Specs
  participant Repo as Artifact Repository
  User->>Agent: Ask data question
  Agent->>Engine: Proposed semantic intent
  Engine->>Policy: Authorize and validate
  Engine->>Engine: Execute governed query
  Engine->>Viz: Create typed chart / UI specs
  Viz-->>User: Dynamic exploration
  User->>Engine: Promote selected view
  Engine->>Policy: Reauthorize publish action
  Engine->>Engine: Freeze layout, bindings and provenance
  Engine->>Repo: Persist immutable dashboard version
  Repo-->>User: Published artifact reference
  Note over Engine,Repo: Refresh data separately; never mutate published definition
